+# 21. Новая функция publish_outcome
+
+В `World`:
+
+```cpp
+void World::publish_outcome(
+    Actor& actor,
+    OutcomeSignal outcome
+);
+```
+
+Пример:
+
+```cpp
+void World::publish_outcome(
+    Actor& actor,
+    OutcomeSignal outcome
